<script>
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    // Get the remove-empty-fields button from the page
    const submitButton = document.querySelector('#remove-empty-fields');
    if (!submitButton) return;

    submitButton.addEventListener('click', event => {
      event.preventDefault();

      const form = document.querySelector('form');

      // Remove all button elements from the form
      const buttons = form.querySelectorAll('button');
      buttons.forEach(button => button.parentNode.removeChild(button));

      // Trigger the real submit button
      const formButton = form.querySelector('[type="submit"]');
      formButton.click();
    });
  });
</script><script type="text/javascript">window.__WEBFLOW_CURRENCY_SETTINGS = {"currencyCode":"USD","symbol":"$","decimal":".","fractionDigits":2,"group":",","template":"{{wf {\"path\":\"symbol\",\"type\":\"PlainText\"} }} {{wf {\"path\":\"amount\",\"type\":\"CommercePrice\"} }} {{wf {\"path\":\"currencyCode\",\"type\":\"PlainText\"} }}","hideDecimalForWholeNumbers":false};</script></head><body><div class="contact-wrapper"><div data-w-id="dcae81e5-9727-d018-168b-d37b0652b4a7" class="contact-underlay"></div><div class="quote-box as"><a data-w-id="5cac6e5b-8a52-15f7-e461-0b5221ce6840" href="#" class="button-2 close w-button">X</a><div class="w-richtext"><h4>Jeff Foster</h4><h5 class="modal-title">Founder and Chief Executive Officer</h5><p>Jeff brings 20+ years of capital markets and fintech experience, including senior leadership roles at TMX Group where he led sales, strategy and product innovation. He also successfully scaled global equities and crypto trading businesses as Head of Sales at FINRA-registered broker Alpaca. Jeff is focused on leading CIX Trading’s efforts to build infrastructure for modern markets.</p></div><div class="social-links modal-social"><a href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/jeff-foster-195ba713" target="_blank" class="social-link modal-social w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb1a_icon-social-linkedin.svg" alt="Linkedin" class="social-link-icon"/></a></div></div></div><div class="contact-wrapper-mike"><div data-w-id="27259738-5337-6c20-7718-96f0a6bc3469" class="contact-underlay"></div><div class="quote-box as"><a data-w-id="27259738-5337-6c20-7718-96f0a6bc346b" href="#" class="button-2 close w-button">X</a><div class="w-richtext"><h4>Mike Taylor</h4><h5 class="modal-title">Head of Sales</h5><p>Mike has over 25 years of capital markets experience, with leadership roles at TMX, Nasdaq, Chi-X, and E*TRADE. He specializes in building sales teams, growing revenue, and managing client relationships across retail and institutional markets. At CIX, he’s driving adoption and connectivity across Canada’s dealer and fintech ecosystem.</p></div><div class="social-links modal-social"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/michael-taylor-2a106615" target="_blank" class="social-link modal-social w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb1a_icon-social-linkedin.svg" alt="Linkedin" class="social-link-icon"/></a></div></div></div><div class="contact-wrapper-darren"><div data-w-id="6df0661f-a571-768d-24d3-e1f803a5d10d" class="contact-underlay"></div><div class="quote-box as"><a data-w-id="6df0661f-a571-768d-24d3-e1f803a5d10f" href="#" class="button-2 close w-button">X</a><div class="w-richtext"><h4>Darren Molloy</h4><h5 class="modal-title">Head of Trading &amp; Operations</h5><p>Darren has over 20 years of experience across trading, compliance, and operations. He’s led trading at Webull, RF/GMP Securities, and NBIN. A Chartered Investment Manager and FCSI®, Darren brings deep regulatory and market structure expertise to CIX’s infrastructure and operational build-out.</p></div><div class="social-links modal-social"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/darrenmolloycimfcsi" target="_blank" class="social-link modal-social w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb1a_icon-social-linkedin.svg" alt="Linkedin" class="social-link-icon"/></a></div></div></div><div class="contact-wrapper-anastassia"><div data-w-id="87e91363-6e25-4a61-590d-8b99f01b8a72" class="contact-underlay"></div><div class="quote-box as"><a data-w-id="87e91363-6e25-4a61-590d-8b99f01b8a74" href="#" class="button-2 close w-button">X</a><div class="w-richtext"><h4>Anastassia Tikhomirova</h4><h5 class="modal-title">Head of Regulatory &amp; Legal</h5><p>Anastassia has held key regulatory roles at major exchanges and investment dealers. At CSE, she helped secure approval for the CSE2 trading book. A JD from Osgoode Hall and Certified Privacy Professional, she leads CIX’s regulatory strategy and compliance initiatives.</p></div></div></div><div class="contact-wrapper-andre"><div data-w-id="0ae8a676-ecf7-012b-4b5d-b78dc54b9056" class="contact-underlay"></div><div class="quote-box as"><a data-w-id="0ae8a676-ecf7-012b-4b5d-b78dc54b9058" href="#" class="button-2 close w-button">X</a><div class="w-richtext"><h4>André Pinto</h4><h5 class="modal-title">Director of Technology</h5><p>André is a seasoned IT executive with over 20 years of driving transformational change and innovation in financial services and capital markets. His deep expertise spans solution architecture, product and project management, and equity trading platforms—leading strategic delivery for major financial institutions.</p></div><div class="social-links modal-social"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/andré-pinto-b550444/" target="_blank" class="social-link modal-social w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb1a_icon-social-linkedin.svg" alt="Linkedin" class="social-link-icon"/></a></div></div></div><div class="contact-wrapper-keeley"><div data-w-id="7900d716-a25f-c3f0-eee0-8ab9d64aecf0" class="contact-underlay"></div><div class="quote-box as"><a data-w-id="7900d716-a25f-c3f0-eee0-8ab9d64aecf2" href="#" class="button-2 close w-button">X</a><div class="w-richtext"><h4>Mike Keeley</h4><h5 class="modal-title">Director of Technology Operations</h5><p>Mike has over 20 years of capital markets experience on the vendor side, with leadership roles at Iress and Belzberg. He has a passion for building strong teams and continuous change and has a proven record in incident management and fostering a collaborative approach to client experience. Mike is focused on setting CIX up for operational success and leading a change mindset to keep what we build current.</p></div><div class="social-links modal-social"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/keeleym/" target="_blank" class="social-link modal-social w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb1a_icon-social-linkedin.svg" alt="Linkedin" class="social-link-icon"/></a></div></div></div><div class="contact-wrapper-terry"><div data-w-id="034ea75e-a797-3088-4aa4-35e68ac10ee3" class="contact-underlay"></div><div class="quote-box as"><a data-w-id="034ea75e-a797-3088-4aa4-35e68ac10ee5" href="#" class="button-2 close w-button">X</a><div class="w-richtext"><h4>Terry Mack</h4><h5 class="modal-title">Chief Financial Officer</h5><p>Terry is a senior financial executive bringing over 25 years of experience in the capital markets and banking industry.  As a CPA, he delivers strong financial oversight shaping business strategy driving business growth and enhancing shareholder value. At Neo Exchange, he led its sale to an S&amp;P 500 company.</p></div><div class="social-links modal-social"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/terry-mack-cpa-ca-accbd-81b50714/" target="_blank" class="social-link modal-social w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb1a_icon-social-linkedin.svg" alt="Linkedin" class="social-link-icon"/></a></div></div></div><div class="contact-wrapper-catherine"><div data-w-id="45388284-1f02-9386-64ed-f3f6a32d9146" class="contact-underlay"></div><div class="quote-box as"><a data-w-id="45388284-1f02-9386-64ed-f3f6a32d9148" href="#" class="button-2 close w-button">X</a><div class="w-richtext"><h4>Catherine Lam Garcia</h4><h5 class="modal-title">Head of Product &amp; Analytics</h5><p>Catherine brings 20+ years of capital markets experience, with leadership roles at Cboe Global Markets and the Toronto Stock Exchange, where she led equity market structure, product design, execution consulting, and business strategy across their Canadian and US equity exchanges. At CIX, she is responsible for driving product strategy and analytics to build a modern Canadian equities marketplace.</p></div><div class="social-links modal-social"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/c3lam/" target="_blank" class="social-link modal-social w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb1a_icon-social-linkedin.svg" alt="Linkedin" class="social-link-icon"/></a></div></div></div><div class="navbar-wrapper"><div class="container---main"><div data-animation="default" data-collapse="medium" data-duration="400" data-easing="ease" data-easing2="ease" role="banner" class="navbar w-nav"><div class="navbar-row"><div class="nav-logo-wrapper"><a href="/" class="nav-logo-link w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/6879127c88ba6212e2b0bb46_cix-orange.svg" loading="eager" width="100" alt="" class="nav-logo-image"/></a></div><div class="nav-menu-wrapper"><nav role="navigation" class="nav-menu w-nav-menu"><div class="nav-links"><a href="/" class="mobile-logo w-inline-block"><img width="100" loading="eager" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67ed7989befb945b9d871abe_cix-orange.svg" class="mobile-logo-image"/></a><a href="/" class="nav-link inside-left-link cixmenu w-nav-link">Home</a><div data-delay="200" data-hover="true" class="nav-link w-dropdown"><div class="dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Trading</div><div class="dropdown-arrow-wrapper"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb7c_interface-icon-arrow-down-dark.svg" class="dropdown-toggle-icon"/><img alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb7c_interface-icon-arrow-down-dark.svg" class="dropdown-toggle-icon"/></div></div><nav class="dropdown-list-wrapper w-dropdown-list"><div class="dropdown-list"><div class="dropdown-links"><a href="/trading/trading-books" class="dropdown-link dark-text w-inline-block"><div>Trading Books</div><div class="dropdown-link-icon-wrapper"><img alt="Arrow right" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3d_interface-icon-arrow-right-small.svg" class="dropdown-link-icon"/><img alt="Arrow right" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3d_interface-icon-arrow-right-small.svg" class="dropdown-link-icon"/></div></a><a href="/trading/notices" class="dropdown-link dark-text w-inline-block"><div>Notices</div><div class="dropdown-link-icon-wrapper"><img alt="Arrow right" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3d_interface-icon-arrow-right-small.svg" class="dropdown-link-icon"/><img alt="Arrow right" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3d_interface-icon-arrow-right-small.svg" class="dropdown-link-icon"/></div></a><a href="/trading/resources" class="dropdown-link dark-text w-inline-block"><div>Resources</div><div class="dropdown-link-icon-wrapper"><img alt="Arrow right" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3d_interface-icon-arrow-right-small.svg" class="dropdown-link-icon"/><img alt="Arrow right" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3d_interface-icon-arrow-right-small.svg" class="dropdown-link-icon"/></div></a><a href="/trading/hours-holidays" class="dropdown-link dark-text w-inline-block"><div>Hours &amp; Holidays</div><div class="dropdown-link-icon-wrapper"><img alt="Arrow right" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3d_interface-icon-arrow-right-small.svg" class="dropdown-link-icon"/><img alt="Arrow right" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3d_interface-icon-arrow-right-small.svg" class="dropdown-link-icon"/></div></a><a href="/trading/pricing" class="dropdown-link dark-text w-inline-block"><div>Pricing</div><div class="dropdown-link-icon-wrapper"><img alt="Arrow right" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3d_interface-icon-arrow-right-small.svg" class="dropdown-link-icon"/><img alt="Arrow right" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3d_interface-icon-arrow-right-small.svg" class="dropdown-link-icon"/></div></a><a id="w-node-_410aadc6-2821-bb51-9593-bde96e0f7e46-6e0f7df9" href="/trading/faq" class="dropdown-link dark-text w-inline-block"><div>Frequently Asked Questions</div><div class="dropdown-link-icon-wrapper"><img alt="Arrow right" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3d_interface-icon-arrow-right-small.svg" class="dropdown-link-icon"/><img alt="Arrow right" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3d_interface-icon-arrow-right-small.svg" class="dropdown-link-icon"/></div></a></div></div></nav></div><a href="/market-data" class="nav-link inside-left-link w-nav-link">Market Data</a><div data-delay="200" data-hover="true" class="nav-link w-dropdown"><div class="dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Company</div><div class="dropdown-arrow-wrapper"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb7c_interface-icon-arrow-down-dark.svg" class="dropdown-toggle-icon"/><img alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb7c_interface-icon-arrow-down-dark.svg" class="dropdown-toggle-icon"/></div></div><nav class="dropdown-list-wrapper w-dropdown-list"><div class="dropdown-list"><div class="dropdown-links"><a href="/company/about" aria-current="page" class="dropdown-link dark-text w-inline-block w--current"><div>About</div><div class="dropdown-link-icon-wrapper"><img alt="Arrow right" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3d_interface-icon-arrow-right-small.svg" class="dropdown-link-icon"/><img alt="Arrow right" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3d_interface-icon-arrow-right-small.svg" class="dropdown-link-icon"/></div></a><a href="/company/careers" class="dropdown-link dark-text w-inline-block"><div>Careers</div><div class="dropdown-link-icon-wrapper"><img alt="Arrow right" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3d_interface-icon-arrow-right-small.svg" class="dropdown-link-icon"/><img alt="Arrow right" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3d_interface-icon-arrow-right-small.svg" class="dropdown-link-icon"/></div></a><a href="/company/contact" class="dropdown-link dark-text w-inline-block"><div>Contact</div><div class="dropdown-link-icon-wrapper"><img alt="Arrow right" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3d_interface-icon-arrow-right-small.svg" class="dropdown-link-icon"/><img alt="Arrow right" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3d_interface-icon-arrow-right-small.svg" class="dropdown-link-icon"/></div></a></div></div></nav></div><a href="/news" class="nav-link inside-left-link w-nav-link">News</a><a href="/company/contact" class="button inside-nav-menu white mobilemenu w-inline-block"><div>Contact Us</div></a></div></nav></div><div class="navbar-right-contents"><a href="#" class="trigger-search-modal w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3c_interface-icon-search-dark.svg" alt="" class="search-icon"/><div class="search-text">Search</div></a><div class="menu-button w-nav-button"><div class="menu-button-wrapper"><div class="menu-button-horziontal"><div class="menu-button-horizontal-line line-1"></div><div class="menu-button-horizontal-line line-2"></div><div class="menu-button-horizontal-line line-3"></div></div><div class="menu-button-cross"><div class="menu-button-cross-line line-1"></div><div class="menu-button-cross-line line-2"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eaa5_icon-cross.svg" alt="" class="nav-menu-close"/><div class="w-embed w-script"><style>
/* Navbar V2 (reverse colour, light pages) dropdown tweaks — mirror of the Navbar V2 - White embed.
   Scoped to .navbar-wrapper:not(.white) so the white navbar is untouched. */

/* Panel: very translucent light glass instead of the solid light-tone background */
.navbar-wrapper:not(.white) .dropdown-list {
  background-color: transparent;
  background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(246, 249, 255, .30) 0%, rgba(246, 249, 255, .42) 100%);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px) saturate(160%);
  backdrop-filter: blur(14px) saturate(160%);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-dark, rgba(31, 39, 27, .2)); /* same stroke as the light pages' dividers */
}

/* Tiles: same corner radius as .button (Explore CIX); every tile is the height of a one-line tile, two-line labels grow upward */
.navbar-wrapper:not(.white) .dropdown-link {
  border-radius: 4px;
  --tile-space: 72px; /* the original top padding */
  height: calc(var(--tile-space) + 12px + 1.5em);
  height: calc(var(--tile-space) + 12px + 1lh);
  padding-top: 12px;
  align-items: flex-end;
}

/* Arrow: one arrow, centred on the label's last line. The wrapper holds two copies that the
   "Dropdown Link - Hover In" Webflow interaction slides across; here GSAP animates the wrapper
   instead, so hide the spare copy and pin the other against the interaction's inline transform. */
.navbar-wrapper:not(.white) .dropdown-link-icon-wrapper {
  flex: none;
  margin-left: 12px;
  margin-bottom: calc((1lh - 16px) / 2);
}
.navbar-wrapper:not(.white) .dropdown-link-icon-wrapper .dropdown-link-icon:not(:last-child) { display: none; }
.navbar-wrapper:not(.white) .dropdown-link-icon-wrapper .dropdown-link-icon { flex: none; transform: none !important; }

/* Hidden until hovered; GSAP animates it in (the class is added by the script, so without JS arrows show as normal) */
.cix-nav-arrows-rev .navbar-wrapper:not(.white) .dropdown-link-icon-wrapper { opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; }

@media screen and (max-width: 479px) {
  .navbar-wrapper:not(.white) .dropdown-link { --tile-space: 60px; }
}
</style>
<script>
// Dropdown arrows glide in on hover/focus (GSAP). Touch devices keep the arrows visible.
(function () {
  if (!window.matchMedia('(hover: hover) and (pointer: fine)').matches) return;
  var reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;

  function init() {
    var gsap = window.gsap;
    var links = document.querySelectorAll('.navbar-wrapper:not(.white) .dropdown-link');
    if (!gsap || !links.length) return;
    document.documentElement.classList.add('cix-nav-arrows-rev');

    links.forEach(function (link) {
      var icon = link.querySelector('.dropdown-link-icon-wrapper');
      if (!icon) return;
      gsap.set(icon, { autoAlpha: 0, x: -10, filter: 'blur(2px)' });

      function show() {
        gsap.to(icon, { autoAlpha: 1, x: 0, filter: 'blur(0px)', duration: reduce ? 0 : 0.32, ease: 'power3.out', overwrite: true });
      }
      function hide() {
        gsap.to(icon, {
          autoAlpha: 0, x: 6, filter: 'blur(2px)', duration: reduce ? 0 : 0.18, ease: 'power2.in', overwrite: true,
          onComplete: function () { gsap.set(icon, { x: -10 }); }
        });
      }
      link.addEventListener('mouseenter', show);
      link.addEventListener('focus', show);
      link.addEventListener('mouseleave', hide);
      link.addEventListener('blur', hide);
    });
  }

  // Wait for the page (and any GSAP it loads in its footer); only fetch GSAP if the page doesn't have it.
  function start() {
    if (window.gsap) return init();
    var s = document.createElement('script');
    s.src = 'https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.12.5/dist/gsap.min.js';
    s.onload = init;
    document.head.appendChild(s);
  }
  if (document.readyState === 'loading') document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', start);
  else start();
})();
</script>
</div></div><section class="section no-padding"><div class="container---main"><div class="page-title"><div class="page-title-left"><h1 class="display-heading about-heading">Canada&#x27;s Next <br/>Generation Equity <br/>Trading Venue </h1><div class="page-title-cta"><div class="heading-four">We are on a mission to modernize Canada’s capital markets through a new equity marketplace: a cost-efficient, client-aligned Alternative Trading System (ATS), purpose-built to serve both retail and institutional participants with greater access, transparency, and innovation.</div></div></div><div class="page-title-right"><div class="video-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/686c961cf928cc2fa2fa2c5e_dariia-lemesheva-hVXgvERo_Ws-unsplash-2.jpg" alt="A Canadian Flag" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/686c961cf928cc2fa2fa2c5e_dariia-lemesheva-hVXgvERo_Ws-unsplash-2-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/686c961cf928cc2fa2fa2c5e_dariia-lemesheva-hVXgvERo_Ws-unsplash-2-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/686c961cf928cc2fa2fa2c5e_dariia-lemesheva-hVXgvERo_Ws-unsplash-2-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/686c961cf928cc2fa2fa2c5e_dariia-lemesheva-hVXgvERo_Ws-unsplash-2-p-1600.jpg 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/686c961cf928cc2fa2fa2c5e_dariia-lemesheva-hVXgvERo_Ws-unsplash-2-p-2000.jpg 2000w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/686c961cf928cc2fa2fa2c5e_dariia-lemesheva-hVXgvERo_Ws-unsplash-2-p-2600.jpg 2600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/686c961cf928cc2fa2fa2c5e_dariia-lemesheva-hVXgvERo_Ws-unsplash-2.jpg 2725w" class="rounded-image about"/><a href="#" class="button video-play-button w-inline-block w-lightbox"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a9