6989f284016281fcfbed9921_MACK_Terry-1170-trans.png 700w" data-w-id="15dfd1e8-d139-9994-72d8-35f304cf203d" sizes="100vw" alt="Terry Mack" class="avatar large-avatar"/><div class="team-member-details-wrapper"><div class="team-member-name-position"><div class="heading-four">Terry Mack</div><div>Chief Financial Officer</div></div><div class="team-member-contact-details"><div class="text-white---faded"><span class="text-light-tone">E:</span> <a href="mailto:terry.mack@thecix.ca" class="text-white---faded">terry.mack@thecix.ca</a></div></div></div></div><div class="team-member"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/68baf149276310f3f691df58_Keeley.png" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/68baf149276310f3f691df58_Keeley-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/68baf149276310f3f691df58_Keeley.png 700w" data-w-id="b5adde49-23ab-c4ce-256c-f21a62c2ad5d" sizes="100vw" alt="Mike Keeley" class="avatar large-avatar"/><div class="team-member-details-wrapper"><div class="team-member-name-position"><div class="heading-four">Mike Keeley</div><div>Director of Technology Operations</div></div><div class="team-member-contact-details"><div><span class="text-light-tone">E: </span><a href="mailto:mike.keeley@thecix.ca"><span class="text-white---faded">mike.keeley@thecix.ca</span></a></div></div></div></div><div class="team-member"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/68baee9206d58c85acba7519_Andre.png" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/68baee9206d58c85acba7519_Andre-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/68baee9206d58c85acba7519_Andre.png 700w" data-w-id="2f532cd1-c783-bd0c-89dd-bb2d4d0ecb80" sizes="100vw" alt="Andre Pinto" class="avatar large-avatar"/><div class="team-member-details-wrapper"><div class="team-member-name-position"><div class="heading-four">André Pinto</div><div>Director of Technology</div></div><div class="team-member-contact-details"><div><span class="text-light-tone">E: </span><a href="mailto:andre.pinto@thecix.ca"><span class="text-white---faded">andre.pinto@thecix.ca</span></a></div></div></div></div><div class="team-member"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/6a111d05ee0c1a83121dd257_Catherine.png" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/6a111d05ee0c1a83121dd257_Catherine-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/6a111d05ee0c1a83121dd257_Catherine.png 700w" data-w-id="eea36651-4544-a653-546f-af27c8ae3081" sizes="100vw" alt="Andre Pinto" class="avatar large-avatar"/><div class="team-member-details-wrapper"><div class="team-member-name-position"><div class="heading-four">Catherine Lam Garcia</div><div>Head of Product &amp; Analytics</div></div><div class="team-member-contact-details"><div><span class="text-light-tone">E: </span><a href="mailto:catherine@thecix.ca"><span class="text-white---faded">catherine@thecix.ca</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section title rethink"><div class="container---main"><h3 class="heading-two title-text heading-three">Rethinking Access, Execution, and Innovation</h3></div></section><section class="section process-step"><div class="container---main"><div class="process-step-wrapper"><div class="process-heading-wrapper"><div class="heading-four process-step-number">01</div><div class="heading-four process-heading">Legacy markets are holding Canada back</div></div><div class="container---m"><div class="process-step-text">Canada’s capital markets are dominated by legacy venues with outdated infrastructure, high costs, and little innovation, leaving traders without the modern tools and access they need to compete on a global scale.</div></div></div></div></section><section class="section process-step"><div class="container---main"><div class="process-step-wrapper"><div class="process-heading-wrapper"><div class="heading-four process-step-number">02</div><div class="heading-four process-heading">Investors deserve better tools</div></div><div class="container---m"><div class="process-step-text">Both institutional and retail investors demand better execution quality and a user experience that meets the demands of today’s modern, fast-moving, data-driven financial environment.</div></div></div></div></section><section class="section process-step last-step"><div class="container---main"><div class="process-step-wrapper"><div class="process-heading-wrapper"><div class="heading-four process-step-number">03</div><div class="heading-four process-heading">The future of Canadian trading</div></div><div class="container---m"><div class="process-step-text">CIX fills this gap by launching a CAD-centric, modern ATS that enables new participants, reduces trading costs, and opens the door to new asset classes, advanced liquidity models, and technology-driven market access.</div></div></div></div></section><div class="footer"><div class="container---main"><div class="footer-columns"><div class="footer-left-column"><div class="footer-details"><a href="/" class="w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67ea0bbd1ac3a50582e22d5f_cix-light.svg" height="150" alt="" class="footer-logo-image"/></a><div class="footer-contact-methods"><div class="contact-method"><div>2210 - 120 Adelaide St West<br/>Toronto, ON M5H 1P9<br/>Canada<br/><br/></div><a href="mailto:info@thecix.ca" class="footer-link">info@thecix.ca</a><a href="tel:+16479477007" class="footer-link">647-947-7007</a></div></div></div></div><div class="footer-right-column"><div class="footer-menus"><div class="footer-menu"><div>Trading</div><div class="footer-links"><a href="/trading/trading-books" class="footer-link">Trading Books</a><a href="/trading/pricing" class="footer-link">Pricing</a><a href="/trading/hours-holidays" class="footer-link">Hours &amp; Holidays</a><a href="/trading/notices" class="footer-link">Notices</a><a href="/trading/resources" class="footer-link">Resources</a><a href="/trading/faq" class="footer-link">FAQ</a></div></div><div class="footer-menu"><div>Market Data</div><div class="footer-links"><a href="/market-data" class="footer-link">Market Data</a></div></div><div class="footer-menu"><div>Company</div><div class="footer-links"><a href="/company/about" aria-current="page" class="footer-link w--current">About CIX</a><a href="/company/about#leadership" class="footer-link">Leadership &amp; Team</a><a href="/company/careers" class="footer-link">Careers</a><a href="/company/contact" class="footer-link">Contact Us</a><a href="/news" class="footer-link">News</a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="footer-bottom-wrapper"><div class="container---main"><div class="footer-columns"><div class="footer-left-column bottom-column"><div class="small-text muted">© <span data-current-year="">2026</span><span> CIX - Markets Evolved.</span></div></div><div class="footer-right-column bottom-column"><div class="footer-bottom-rows"><div class="footer-social-row"><div class="social-links"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/cix-trading/" target="_blank" class="social-link w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb29_icon-social-linkedin-light.svg" alt="Linkedin" class="social-link-icon"/></a></div><div class="footer-small-links"><a href="/legal/terms-and-conditions" class="small-text footer-link">Terms &amp; Conditions</a><a href="/legal/privacy-policy" class="small-text footer-link">Privacy Policy</a><a href="/legal/cix-standard-access-terms" class="small-text footer-link">Standard Access Terms</a><a href="/legal/cix-market-data-terms" class="small-text footer-link">Market Data Terms</a></div></div><div class="fine-print muted">CIX Trading Inc. (<strong>CIX, us, we, or other like terms</strong>) is the operator of CIX, an alternative trading system (<strong>ATS</strong>) operating three separate trading venues: CIX | IntelligentCross ASPEN, CIX | IntelligentCross ASPEN VERT, and CIX | IntelligentCross Midpoint. The Ontario Securities Commission (<strong>OSC</strong>) is our principal regulator. CIX is also regulated by the Canadian Investment Regulatory Organization (<strong>CIRO</strong>) as both a Dealer Member and a Marketplace Member. <br/><br/>By accessing and using this site, thecix.ca (the Site), you agree to the Site’s Terms &amp; Conditions as well as our Privacy Policy.<br/><br/>© <span data-current-year="">2026</span><span> CIX Trading Inc. © </span><span data-current-year="">2026</span><span> Imperative Execution Inc. All rights reserved.</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="search-modal"><div class="search-modal-screen"></div><div class="search-modal-container"><form action="/search" class="search-form w-form"><input class="form-input w-input" maxlength="256" name="query" placeholder="Search…" type="search" id="search" required=""/><input type="submit" class="button small w-button" value="Search"/></form></div></div><script src="https://d3e54v103j8qbb.cloudfront.net/js/jquery-3.5.1.min.dc5e7f18c8.js?site=67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31" type="text/javascript" integrity="sha256-9/aliU8dGd2tb6OSsuzixeV4y/faTqgFtohetphbbj0=" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/js/webflow.schunk.9c4189d21835a018.js" type="text/javascript" integrity="sha384-vAKf03v6jnvx/wEXW0yZkKjXCi4w5jThZYSoqxikgHGJIbmJx9Gyo4cbOkAOwJAV" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/js/webflow.schunk.b1f46b4818dd94a1.js" type="text/javascript" integrity="sha384-Swo0l0v67BjMVj+pOHTAc/225nwIMQVqe+5JEC9H5qJu98x2gmdZJrx2gWltd6ys" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/js/webflow.39d4e800.a52b28e32e4231db.js" type="text/javascript" integrity="sha384-aXp30O49BMZuvM9lX1dumP7MdZr8++dnPZSgFh3m5ceuIulckH1SbxHL7Bb9W6Yd" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script>
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    // Get the remove-empty-fields button from the page
    const submitButton = document.querySelector('#remove-empty-fields');
    if (!submitButton) return;

    submitButton.addEventListener('click', event => {
      event.preventDefault();

      const form = document.querySelector('form');

      // Remove all button elements from the form
      const buttons = form.querySelectorAll('button');
      buttons.forEach(button => button.parentNode.removeChild(button));

      // Trigger the real submit button
      const formButton = form.querySelector('[type="submit"]');
      formButton.click();
    });
  });
</script>

<script>
  // Keep copyright years current: any element with data-current-year shows this calendar year.
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-current-year]').forEach(function (el) {
    el.textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
  });
</script></body></html>